window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Erica Stone has just graduated from college and is heading to medical school in the fall. Everything is going according to plan, until a dream vacation with her two best friends turns into a nightmare. Left with no other option, she is forced to put her trust in a mysterious man who has secrets of his own. Together, they work to uncover the sinister plot that has changed their lives...but can they stay alive long enough to expose the truth?</p>"; 
